{x1, x2}_D = 0
{x1, p1}_D = (x2^2 + x3^2)/(x1^2 + x2^2 + x3^2) ;  {x1, p2}_D = -x1*x2/(x1^2 + x2^2 + x3^2)
{p1, p2}_D = -(p2*x1 - p1*x2)/(x1^2 + x2^2 + x3^2)
{x_i, p_j}_D - (delta_ij - x_i x_j/|x|^2): [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]
{p_i, p_j}_D - (x_j p_i - x_i p_j)/|x|^2: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]
four constraints give the same brackets of x and p: True
